Q: A patient missed their appointment last week. How do they reschedule?
A: Go to My Appointments, select the missed visit, and choose Reschedule. The window is 14 days from the missed date; after that the system closes the booking and the patient needs a new referral code, which only the reviewing clinician can issue. Front-desk staff cannot override an expired booking. For anything that needs clinical judgement, direct the patient to an AfyaPlus provider.
