Q: A staff member is locked out of the staff portal. What are the steps?
A: Verify the staff member's identity against the duty roster, then raise a lockout ticket in the admin console. Only the facility administrator can reset credentials. Sharing another person's login as a workaround is a violation of the AfyaPlus access policy and must never happen, even under time pressure. Clinical questions are always routed to an AfyaPlus provider rather than answered at the desk.
