Q: What documents are needed to register a new patient?
A: Registration takes three steps: verify identity with the national ID or passport, confirm the phone number via the SMS code, and issue a health record number from the registration module. The duty administrator handles all these steps, so hand the documents over and let them complete the registration. Clinical questions are always routed to an AfyaPlus provider rather than answered at the desk.
