Q: A patient disputes a charge on their invoice. What should the front desk do?
A: The route is Billing support, quoting the invoice number. Cases close within 48 hours, and until then no one at the facility should promise a refund, an adjustment, or a specific outcome, since only the billing team can make that call. As with every workflow, clinical decisions stay with the AfyaPlus clinical team.
